# =============================================================================
# Dissertation workflow - .gitignore
#
# This repository holds ONLY the pipeline: scripts, the skill, default templates,
# tests and documentation. Everything that belongs to one student (their details,
# documents, chapters, references, Zotero data and secrets) stays on their own
# machine and is never committed or pushed.
#
# Private areas are handled as whitelists ("ignore everything, then allow the
# known pipeline files"), so a personal file dropped in the wrong place is
# ignored by default instead of being pushed by accident.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Secrets and private settings -------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
credentials*.json

# ---- Dissertation projects (ALL private work) --------------------------------
# Each dissertation lives in projects/<name>/ with its OWN git repository.
# Nothing in projects/ is committed here, including the active-project marker.
/projects/*
!/projects/.gitkeep

# ---- Shared config: only the example and the default templates are public ----
/config/*
!/config/project.example.yaml
!/config/templates/
# (old single-project layout: project.yaml, cover.*, guidelines/, feedback/,
#  existing/, style.yaml, requirements/, cover_template.docx ... all ignored)

# ---- Old flat layout outputs at the root (project.py migrate moves them) -----
/output/
/references/

# ---- docs/ holds pipeline documentation only, never a student's documents ----
/docs/cover/
/docs/guidelines/
/docs/past_work/
/docs/feedback/

# ---- Personal documents dropped at the repository root -----------------------
/*.docx
/*.doc
/*.dotx
/*.pdf
/*.odt
/*.rtf
/*.pptx
/*.xlsx
/*.csv
/*.bib
/*.ris
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.zip

# ---- Zotero / reference manager local data ----------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
zotero.json

# ---- Build intermediates and logs -------------------------------------------
.build/
*.log

# ---- Local tools and environments (installed per machine, see SETUP.md) -----
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
/tools/

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- Claude Code: only the shared settings and the skill are public ---------
# (re-included here because a global gitignore may hide .claude/ and CLAUDE.md)
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/skills/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---- Office, editor and OS clutter ------------------------------------------
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
.~lock.*#
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
